{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00105",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 5.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Oh, hello? Doctor? They told me to come straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.68,
      "end_seconds": 9.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.05,
      "end_seconds": 18.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Well, I've been having wheezing. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.99,
      "end_seconds": 23.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.79,
      "end_seconds": 28.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I've, I've had it for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.7,
      "end_seconds": 35.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.62,
      "end_seconds": 62.24,
      "duration_seconds": 25.62,
      "text": "Well, it's worse with dust and cold air. I'd say a few times a day. Moderate, I'd say. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. And a night-time cough, too. Oh, there's shortness of breath on walking as well. So, as for shortness of breath on walking, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. It's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.55,
      "end_seconds": 64.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.59,
      "end_seconds": 67.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.84,
      "end_seconds": 70.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Any runny nose or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.45,
      "end_seconds": 74.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.7,
      "end_seconds": 78.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.59,
      "end_seconds": 82.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Right, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.42,
      "end_seconds": 86.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.03,
      "end_seconds": 92.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "So, um, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 92.62,
      "end_seconds": 102.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 37.5, respiratory rate 22. Pulse is 98 beats a minute, BP is 142 over 74, SpO2 94 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.43,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Thanks. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.6,
      "end_seconds": 109.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, um, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.11,
      "end_seconds": 115.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.24,
      "end_seconds": 128.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "So, I'm on Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.68,
      "end_seconds": 132.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.89,
      "end_seconds": 133.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.67,
      "end_seconds": 150.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.89,
      "end_seconds": 156.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Uh, um, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.2,
      "end_seconds": 158.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.79,
      "end_seconds": 161.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.33,
      "end_seconds": 165.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.36,
      "end_seconds": 173.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "I have asthma, for about a year. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 181.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I see. Yes, I can see the asthma in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.57,
      "end_seconds": 185.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.39,
      "end_seconds": 187.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.5,
      "end_seconds": 201.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I can hear a widespread wheeze on both sides when you breathe out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.38,
      "end_seconds": 204.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Okay, um, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.99,
      "end_seconds": 207.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.04,
      "end_seconds": 226.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "You're speaking in full sentences, which is reassuring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.13,
      "end_seconds": 251.5,
      "duration_seconds": 19.37,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like an asthma flare-up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.73,
      "end_seconds": 258.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "So, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.76,
      "end_seconds": 275.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.31,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an asthma flare-up is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had wheezing for about a week, moderate, and no fever or runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.41,
      "end_seconds": 277.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Right, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.02,
      "end_seconds": 292.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.8,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.07,
      "end_seconds": 297.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Right, thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 297.6,
      "end_seconds": 301.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I've already done a peak flow reading, it's ready for you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.47,
      "end_seconds": 311.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Okay, thanks, I'll look at that. I'll start you on Seretide inhaler, 250 micrograms, two puffs twice a day, long term. It's for asthma control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.7,
      "end_seconds": 315.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.14,
      "end_seconds": 336.07,
      "duration_seconds": 19.93,
      "text": "I'd like you to take prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for asthma flare-up. Let me watch you use the inhaler, a lot of people don't get the full dose. Rinse your mouth after the steroid inhaler. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.41,
      "end_seconds": 347.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the inhaler isn't helping or you can't speak in full sentences, call us the same day or go to emergency. Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.87,
      "end_seconds": 351.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Uh, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.42,
      "end_seconds": 358.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.54,
      "end_seconds": 370.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "So, I take the Seretide inhaler, 250 micrograms, two puffs twice a day and take the prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.36,
      "end_seconds": 376.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.73,
      "end_seconds": 380.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Okay, so thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.78,
      "end_seconds": 382.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}